  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.BaseOASIS v2.0.5\n\nConnects the OASIS to Base -- the Coinbase-incubated OP Stack L2, part of the Ethereum Superchain, with EVM equivalence, sub-cent fees, and Coinbase ecosystem integration. Stores OASIS holons, avatars, and NFTs. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.4\n- Add native CQL balance profiles for Base Avalanche and BNB Chain (e4da3c4)\n- Integrate verified Base wallet and record decoding (2824c89)\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/Providers/Blockchain/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.BaseOASIS",
